  "overview": "The tumultuous tale of \"Risa\" (Bella-Ranee Campen), who runs a wedding planning company, along with her close-knit circle of friends including \"Jan\" (Baifern-Passakorn Ponlaboon) and \"Aoffy\" (Pingpong-Thongchai Thongkanthom). They find themselves tasked with orchestrating a grand wedding for \"Arun\" (Mahir Pandi) and \"Monica\" (Anahita Bhooshan), an Indian newlywed couple who have brought along a substantial entourage of relatives to conduct their ceremony in Thailand. With \"Tim\" (Bright Vachirawit Chivaaree) serving as the event's photographer, this Indian wedding extravaganza is poised to be filled with turmoil as former lovers reunite. Join us as we find out who reconnects with their ex and whether love and bygones will resurface.",
